{"timestamp":"2026-10-02T17:37:24.016Z","experiment":"baseline-v0","runNumber":1,"datasetVersion":"seed-v1","promptVersion":"baseline-v0","questionId":"net-revenue","questionText":"What is net revenue after discounts and refunds?","referenceResult":[{"net_revenue":"15520.00"}],"expectedAnswer":{"type":"number","value":15520,"tolerance":0},"modelOutput":"To calculate the **net revenue** (after discounts and refunds) for all orders, we need to compute:  \n**Net Revenue = Gross Amount - Discount Amount - Refund Amount**\n\nLet’s go through each order:\n\n1. O001: 1200.00 - 100.00 - 0.00 = **1100.00**\n2. O002: 300.00 - 20.00 - 0.00 = **280.00**\n3. O003: 550.00 - 50.00 - 0.00 = **500.00**\n4. O004: 200.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **200.00**\n5. O005: 450.00 - 45.00 - 100.00 = **305.00**\n6. O006: 900.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **900.00**\n7. O007: 180.00 - 10.00 - 0.00 = **170.00**\n8. O008: 700.00 - 70.00 - 200.00 = **430.00**\n9. O009: 650.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **650.00**\n10. O010: 250.00 - 25.00 - 225.00 = **0.00** (fully refunded after discount)\n11. O011: 1100.00 - 100.00 - 0.00 = **1000.00**\n12. O012: 400.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **400.00**\n13. O013: 300.00 - 30.00 - 50.00 = **220.00**\n14. O014: 800.00 - 80.00 - 0.00 = **720.00**\n15. O015: 350.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **350.00**\n16. O016: 1400.00 - 140.00 - 0.00 = **1260.00**\n17. O017: 500.00 - 50.00 - 0.00 = **450.00**\n18. O018: 600.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **600.00**\n19. O019: 220.00 - 20.00 - 50.00 = **150.00**\n20. O020: 480.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **480.00**\n21. O021: 1000.00 - 100.00 - 300.00 = **600.00**\n22. O022: 260.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **260.00**\n23. O023: 750.00 - 75.00 - 0.00 = **675.00**\n24. O024: 900.00 - 90.00 - 0.00 = **810.00**\n25. O025: 320.00 - 20.00 - 300.00 = **0.00** (fully refunded after discount)\n26. O026: 1250.00 - 50.00 - 0.00 = **1200.00**\n27. O027: 420.00 - 20.00 - 0.00 = **400.00**\n28. O028: 340.00 - 0.00 - 40.00 = **300.00**\n29. O029: 850.00 - 0.00 - 0.00 = **850.00**\n30. O030: 390.00 - 30.00 - 100.00 = **260.00**\n\nNow, summing all net revenues:\n\n```\n1100 + 280 + 500 + 200 + 305 + 900 + 170 + 430 + 650 + 0 \n+ 1000 + 400 + 220 + 720 + 350 + 1260 + 450 + 600 \n+ 150 + 480 + 600 + 260 + 675 + 810 + 0 \n+ 1200 + 400 + 300 + 850 + 260\n```\n\nLet's compute step by step:\n\nGrouped sums:\n\nFirst 10 (O001–O010):  \n= 1100 + 280 + 500 + 200 + 305 + 900 + 170 + 430 + 650 + 0 = **4535**\n\nNext 10 (O011–O020):  \n= 1000 + 400 + 220 + 720 + 350 + 1260 + 450 + 600 + 150 + 480 = **5630**\n\nNext 10 (O021–O030):  \n= 600 + 260 + 675 + 810 + 0 + 1200 + 400 + 300 + 850 + 260 = **5155**\n\nTotal = 4535 + 5630 + 5155 = **15320**\n\n✅ Final Answer: **15320.00**","modelName":"qwen3.5:4b","tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":2173,"outputTokens":1646,"totalTokens":3819},"latencyMs":64641,"requestId":null,"status":"success","error":null}
